sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client App
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant TL as ThreadLocal (JVM Context)
    participant Engine as In-Memory Feature Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database


    Client->>GW: HTTP GET /api/v1/boards (Bearer JWT)
    GW->>GW: Trích xuất tenant_id="T-10", tier="PRO"
    GW->>TL: Lưu TenantContext(id="T-10", tier="PRO")
    GW->>Engine: EvaluateFlag("export_excel", Context)
    Engine-->>GW: Trả về TRUE (Đánh giá in-memory < 1ms)
    GW->>DB: Truy vấn dữ liệu với Ngữ cảnh Tenant
    DB-->>GW: Dữ liệu thuộc Tenant T-10
    GW->>TL: Giải phóng Context (clear())
    GW-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (Kèm tính năng Export Excel)
